cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Grounding-Source Comparison Exhibit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Clouatre"
    given-names: "Hugues"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-4291-1999"
    affiliation: "Universite de Bordeaux"
repository-code: https://github.com/clouatre-labs/grounding-source-exhibit
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-11-21"
version: "2.1.1"
abstract: >
  Pre-registered, three-arm comparison of grounding-source payloads
  (frozen llms.txt, full frozen knowledge-graph.json, and the frozen OKF
  v0.3 bundle) on 63 sealed questions per arm across four preregistered
  families with a per-family answerability map (correct abstention scores
  1). Item score: kg-json 61/63, llms.txt 55/63 (McNemar exact, Holm
  p=0.070), okf-bundle 31/63 (Holm p<1e-5 against both). Supersedes
  version 0.1.0 (v1 seal, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24410381).
keywords:
  - llm-agents
  - knowledge-graph
  - open-knowledge-format
  - pre-registered-experiment
  - reproducibility
  - llm-evaluation
identifiers:
